      "content": "it's not even about the pain anymore, i guess. it's just that the version of me that mattered is dead. the athlete, the person who had a future... that person isn't coming back. it feels more like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life, watching someone else live in my skin. how do you even keep going when the main character of your story has already left the building?",
